      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.30 (vs ₹2.48 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.30 (down from ₹2.48 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹279.4m (up 61% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.41m (down 88% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.9% (down from 11% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 26% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 18% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
